<title>SRI LANKA: Distilleries Co 9-month net up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Distilleries Co 9-month net up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Distilleries Company of Sri Lanka Ltd for nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Income	   6,355.89   vs	 5,276.75</p>
<p>     Net profit	 230.13   vs	   190.84</p>
<p>     Tax		  164.40   vs	   172.80</p>
<p>NOTE - Distilleries Company of Sri Lanka is the country's main producer of alcohol and spirits.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
